*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% HP LaserJet @MODEL@ - native ZjStream driver (hpzjs @VERSION@)
*% Filter: rastertozjs (arm64 + x86_64), no Rosetta required.
*% Copyright (c) 2026 Nicola Ferralis - SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
*% Page sizes, margins and media types follow HP's original 1.6.1 PPD.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "@VERSION@"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPZJS@MODELNUM@.PPD"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet @MODEL@)"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet @MODEL@ (hpzjs)"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet @MODEL@ hpzjs"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet @MODEL@, hpzjs @VERSION@"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP LaserJet @MODEL@;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "@PPM@"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.3
*cupsModelNumber: 4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 /Library/Printers/hpzjs/filter/rastertozjs"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-command 100 /Library/Printers/hpzjs/filter/commandtozjs"
*cupsCommands: "Clean ReportLevels"
*cupsMarkerName black/Black: ""
*APPrinterIconPath: "/Library/Printers/hpzjs/icons/HP LaserJet.icns"
*JCLBegin: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL JOB<0A>"
*JCLToPSInterpreter: "@PJL ENTER LANGUAGE = ZJS <0A>"
*JCLEnd: "<1B>%-12345X@PJL EOJ<0A><1B>%-12345X"
*%
*% Firmware: the LaserJet 1018 and 1020 lose their firmware at power off;
*% it is uploaded automatically before the first job when needed.
*zjsFirmwareFile: "/Library/Printers/hpzjs/firmware/hp@FWMODEL@.fw"
*%
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/ProRes 1200 dpi: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *zjsHalftone/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zjsHalftone
*DefaultzjsHalftone: Screen
*zjsHalftone Screen/Screen (documents, graphics): ""
*zjsHalftone Diffusion/Error diffusion (photos): ""
*zjsHalftone Threshold/Threshold (text and line art only): ""
*CloseUI: *zjsHalftone

*OpenUI *zjsGamma/Mid-tone Lightening: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zjsGamma
*DefaultzjsGamma: 1.0
*zjsGamma 1.0/None: ""
*zjsGamma 1.25/Light: ""
*zjsGamma 1.5/Medium: ""
*zjsGamma 1.8/Strong: ""
*CloseUI: *zjsGamma

*OpenUI *zjsFirmware/Firmware Upload: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zjsFirmware
*DefaultzjsFirmware: Auto
*zjsFirmware Auto/Automatic (when the printer needs it): ""
*zjsFirmware Always/Before every job: ""
*zjsFirmware Never/Never: ""
*CloseUI: *zjsFirmware

