*MediaType Prepunched/Prepunched: "<< /cupsMediaType 515 /MediaType (Prepunched)>> setpagedevice"
*MediaType Recycled/Recycled: "<< /cupsMediaType 516 /MediaType (Recycled)>> setpagedevice"
