*OpenUI *InputSlot/Media Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Tray1
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feed: "<</MediaPosition 4>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*JCLOpenUI *JamRecovery/Jam Recovery: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 90 JCLSetup *JamRecovery
*DefaultJamRecovery: False
*JamRecovery True/Yes: "@PJL SET JAMRECOVERY=ON <0A>"
*JamRecovery False/No: "@PJL SET JAMRECOVERY=OFF <0A>"
*CloseUI: *JamRecovery

*JCLOpenUI *PrintDensity/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11.1 JCLSetup *PrintDensity
*DefaultPrintDensity: 3
*PrintDensity 1/1: "@PJL SET DENSITY=1 <0A>"
*PrintDensity 2/2: "@PJL SET DENSITY=2 <0A>"
*PrintDensity 3/3: "@PJL SET DENSITY=3 <0A>"
*PrintDensity 4/4: "@PJL SET DENSITY=4 <0A>"
*PrintDensity 5/5: "@PJL SET DENSITY=5 <0A>"
*CloseUI: *PrintDensity

*OpenUI *REt/REt: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *REt
*DefaultREt: True
*REt True/Yes: ""
*REt False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *REt

*OpenUI *EconoMode/EconoMode (Save Toner): Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10.3 AnySetup *EconoMode
*DefaultEconoMode: False
*EconoMode False/No: ""
*EconoMode True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *EconoMode

